      "v": 7,
      "zh": "却对我说：『你要怀孕生一个儿子，所以清酒浓酒都不可喝，一切不洁之物也不可吃；因为这孩子从出胎一直到死，必归　神作拿细耳人。』」",
      "en": "He said to me, ‘Look, you will conceive and have a son.[NOTE:1] So now, do not drink wine or beer and do not eat any food that will make you ritually unclean.[NOTE:2] For the child will be dedicated[NOTE:3] to God from birth till the day he dies.’”",
