      "v": 8,
      "zh": "玛挪亚就祈求耶和华说：「主啊，求你再差遣那神人到我们这里来，好指教我们怎样待这将要生的孩子。」",
      "en": "Manoah prayed to the Lord,[NOTE:1] “Please, Lord, allow the man sent from God[NOTE:2] to visit[NOTE:3] us again, so he can teach[NOTE:4] us how we should raise[NOTE:5] the child who will be born.”",
