    {
      "v": 9,
      "zh": "神应允玛挪亚的话；妇人正坐在田间的时候，　神的使者又到她那里，她丈夫玛挪亚却没有同她在一处。",
      "en": "God answered Manoah’s prayer.[NOTE:1] God’s angel visited[NOTE:2] the woman again while she was sitting in the field. But her husband Manoah was not with her.",
